.SH NAME
gmc-config-set-apikey - Set the OpenAI API key (hidden input)


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgmc config set apikey [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Read the OpenAI API key from a hidden interactive prompt and store it in OS credential storage.
After storage succeeds, gmc removes all api_key fields from the configuration file.
A terminal is required. If OS credential storage is unavailable, use GMC_API_KEY instead.


